      "learning_outcomes": "After taking this course, students are expected to master the basic writing, reading, and communication skills such as:\n(1) the pronunciations, marks and writings of Arabic letters;\n(2) greetings in Islamic way and normal way;\n(3) exchanging basic personal information with someone in a social occasion;\n(4) describing an object, shopping, making an appointment, offering help, and describing food.",
